 ],
 "notes": "Bucket names also accepted as bucket_prefix (\"<account>-bucketN-\"); a name with a random string after the stated suffix (no longer ending in the suffix) is rejected. Account prefix: planned name starts with the plan's caller-identity account, or every declared bucket name starts with data.aws_caller_identity...account_id or a local named for the account. Public access: per-bucket blocks or an account-level public access block. CMK binding read from declared kms_master_key_id (the key ARN is unknown at plan)."
